<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>No more in vain need we struggle,</l><l>Trying the way in to find.</l><l>Praise God—we’re in Him already,</l><l>Hallelujah, abiding in the vine.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In us, the ointment is moving,</l><l>’Tis the anointing divine;</l><l>God’s precious essence bestowing,</l><l>While abiding, abiding in the vine.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now in the life-flow we’re living,</l><l>O how the light in us shines!</l><l>Both God and man are at home now</l><l>By the mutual abiding in the vine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
